sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant GW as Object Gateway
    participant IAM as Identity & Access
    participant KMS as PQ Key Mgmt (Seal)
    Client->>GW: ClientHello (X25519 + ML-KEM-768 shares)
    GW->>IAM: validate device posture + identity
    IAM-->>GW: identity assertion (ML-DSA signed)
    GW-->>Client: ServerHello (hybrid key agreement)
    Note over Client,GW: TLS 1.3 hybrid session established (classical+PQ)
    Client->>GW: request + purpose token
    GW->>KMS: unwrap object key (ML-KEM-1024)
    KMS-->>GW: session data key (AES-256-GCM)
    GW-->>Client: response (sealed payload)